rule c2: C2 lays the object's .bss out by walking a 1024-bucket table of the names' hashes: value 17, count 21, height 125, index 220, total 471, width 674; the listing still prints declaration order, so the object is the witness
cl /O2
obj
  section * .bss bss rw- size=0x18 align=4
obj
  symbol ?value@@3HA s*+0x0 external
obj
  symbol ?count@@3HA s*+0x4 external
obj
  symbol ?height@@3HA s*+0x8 external
obj
  symbol ?index@@3HA s*+0xc external
obj
  symbol ?total@@3HA s*+0x10 external
obj
  symbol ?width@@3HA s*+0x14 external
data
  _BSS SEGMENT
  ?count@@3HA DD 01H DUP (?)
  ?total@@3HA DD 01H DUP (?)
